WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:54.635
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:54.905 --> 01:55.745
You're awake.

3
01:56.825 --> 01:59.105
Perfect timing. I was just about to make breakfast.

4
02:01.665 --> 02:03.585
How about I make it instead?

5
02:03.665 --> 02:06.265
Consider it my way of thanking you for hosting me.

6
02:06.345 --> 02:07.745
Does that mean I'm getting a feast?

7
02:10.024 --> 02:11.585
You're an international student,

8
02:11.665 --> 02:13.545
so you must have instant noodles at home, right?

9
02:14.145 --> 02:16.945
Growing up, the best thing I could ever cook was instant noodles.

10
02:17.025 --> 02:19.385
Do you want to try?

11
02:21.665 --> 02:24.465
I make incredible poached eggs too. They never fall apart.

12
02:27.585 --> 02:28.625
Impressive.

13
02:29.945 --> 02:32.345
Why does that sound so sarcastic?

14
02:33.225 --> 02:35.585
That's unfair. I was clearly expressing my admiration.

15
02:36.905 --> 02:39.425
If you don't believe me, we can have a cook-off.

16
02:39.505 --> 02:41.025
We'll each make a bowl.

17
02:42.985 --> 02:44.385
You want to compete over this too?

18
02:44.465 --> 02:47.065
I'm just trying to learn from your admirable qualities.

19
02:47.145 --> 02:49.785
Back when we joined the lab and competed for the Vitality Award,

20
02:49.865 --> 02:51.865
didn't you say we shouldn't try to cozy up,

21
02:51.945 --> 02:53.465
but should compete properly instead?

22
02:54.065 --> 02:55.225
That was ages ago.

23
02:56.385 --> 02:57.745
Are we doing this or not?

24
02:58.545 --> 03:00.225
All right. Whatever you say.

25
03:02.385 --> 03:04.025
You're cheating.

26
03:05.905 --> 03:07.585
It's called the competitive spirit.

27
03:08.345 --> 03:10.425
So which bowl do you want?

28
03:21.185 --> 03:23.465
Aren't we being a little childish?

29
03:24.265 --> 03:25.545
Don't drag me into this.

30
03:25.625 --> 03:28.185
Even if we are, it's because of you.

31
03:29.225 --> 03:30.345
I'll admit that.

32
03:32.825 --> 03:36.825
By the way, I want to go back to the dorm to check on things.

33
03:36.905 --> 03:38.705
I have to resolve the situation eventually.

34
03:39.945 --> 03:41.625
-I'll go with you. -It's okay.

35
03:41.705 --> 03:44.345
Trust me. I can handle it myself.

36
04:19.785 --> 04:21.025
What are you doing here?

37
04:22.385 --> 04:23.785
Were you worried I couldn't handle it?

38
04:25.665 --> 04:28.345
Not worried. Just concerned.

39
04:30.185 --> 04:31.345
Are you hungry?

40
04:31.425 --> 04:32.785
Let's get something to eat first.

41
04:39.145 --> 04:41.225
That Theresa was completely out of line.

42
04:41.305 --> 04:43.945
She tried to make me pay the fire alarm response fee.

43
04:44.025 --> 04:45.225
And then?

44
04:45.305 --> 04:48.465
After a battle of words, she didn't get a single cent from me.

45
04:48.545 --> 04:50.305
She even apologized.

46
04:50.385 --> 04:51.225
You're amazing.

47
04:52.345 --> 04:55.905
But since she apologized, paid the compensation,

48
04:55.985 --> 04:57.105
and showed a decent attitude,

49
04:57.185 --> 04:59.225
plus she has an active lease contract,

50
04:59.305 --> 05:03.145
the dorm manager has no plans to ask her to move out or evict her.

51
05:03.825 --> 05:06.945
Even if she left, I'd still be worried about your safety living there.

52
05:07.025 --> 05:09.345
After all, they know where you live.

53
05:12.465 --> 05:14.905
Actually, I'm not surprised at all that you handled it well.

54
05:14.985 --> 05:16.385
That's just how you are.

55
05:16.465 --> 05:19.385
You've always shouldered everything alone and solved problems by yourself.

56
05:20.225 --> 05:21.705
Then why ask so many questions?

57
05:22.545 --> 05:24.425
Because I want to hear you talk.

58
05:24.505 --> 05:26.505
If you're willing to speak, I'll always listen.

59
05:29.025 --> 05:30.385
But I want you to know

60
05:31.225 --> 05:32.545
that you're not alone.

61
05:33.465 --> 05:36.145
Whenever and wherever you need me,

62
05:36.225 --> 05:37.305
I'll be there.

63
05:42.865 --> 05:45.305
And of course, even if you don't need me,

64
05:45.385 --> 05:46.425
I'll still be around.

65
05:47.145 --> 05:48.785
At worst, just waiting nearby.

66
05:51.545 --> 05:52.785
Got it.

67
05:52.865 --> 05:53.945
Don't worry.

68
05:54.025 --> 05:57.105
I won't compromise myself by continuing to live there.

69
05:57.185 --> 05:58.945
There's no way I'm living with someone like her.

70
06:01.745 --> 06:02.825
Then

71
06:03.385 --> 06:05.705
what would your ideal roommate be like?

72
06:08.385 --> 06:11.305
Actually, I'm not asking for much.

73
06:11.385 --> 06:15.145
First, they have to be clean and not leave trash lying around.

74
06:15.225 --> 06:17.585
Second, they should keep regular hours

75
06:17.665 --> 06:20.105
and not bring random people back home.

76
06:21.305 --> 06:22.905
I can accept pretty much anything else.

77
06:23.625 --> 06:26.385
But since we're talking about an ideal roommate,

78
06:27.145 --> 06:28.585
I'll add one more thing.

79
06:28.665 --> 06:29.665
We should get along well.

80
06:36.105 --> 06:37.825
Do I qualify to be your roommate then?

81
06:42.425 --> 06:44.145
I'd like to apply for the position.

82
06:44.225 --> 06:46.545
And if possible, I hope to be your ideal one.

83
06:47.625 --> 06:49.705
Besides everything you just listed,

84
06:49.785 --> 06:51.305
I can also make you breakfast every day.

85
06:52.705 --> 06:55.625
Of course, I'll have to work on my poached eggs.

86
06:57.065 --> 06:58.545
If you ever get bored,

87
06:58.625 --> 07:00.025
we can watch movies together.

88
07:00.105 --> 07:01.785
I'm fine with any genre.

89
07:02.385 --> 07:05.225
Or we can go for walks together.

90
07:05.305 --> 07:06.585
I know Berlin pretty well.

91
07:11.665 --> 07:15.105
Why does this sound so much like a job interview?

92
07:16.785 --> 07:18.465
So is my application approved?

93
07:20.705 --> 07:21.865
Approved.

94
07:24.705 --> 07:25.585
Great!

95
07:25.665 --> 07:26.505
In that case,

96
07:27.185 --> 07:28.185
my dear roommate,

97
07:28.265 --> 07:29.865
come somewhere with me tomorrow.

98
07:43.705 --> 07:45.185
This is…

99
07:45.865 --> 07:47.145
Our new home.

100
07:47.705 --> 07:49.705
The old apartment was close to the research institute,

101
07:49.785 --> 07:51.865
but it took you an hour to get to school.

102
07:52.585 --> 07:54.425
This place is right in the middle.

103
07:54.505 --> 07:55.785
It's perfect.

104
07:57.625 --> 07:59.545
Besides, I'd been wanting to move anyway.

105
07:59.625 --> 08:01.945
I couldn't just keep staying in that place forever.

106
08:03.225 --> 08:07.145
I have some money I made from investments saved, so I decided to get a bigger place.

107
08:07.865 --> 08:09.025
Investments?

108
08:10.305 --> 08:12.865
A few senior classmates and I invested in a biotech startup.

109
08:13.505 --> 08:15.425
We got lucky. The company was acquired.

110
08:15.505 --> 08:16.585
It's no fortune,

111
08:16.665 --> 08:19.505
but renting this place definitely won't be a problem.

112
08:20.585 --> 08:23.265
When did you start looking for places?

113
08:24.905 --> 08:26.905
Yesterday, before I picked you up.

114
08:28.745 --> 08:31.745
You already sent me the offer letter. You can't take it back now.

115
08:32.784 --> 08:34.505
Come on. Let me show you around.

116
08:36.585 --> 08:37.705
Here's the kitchen.

117
08:37.784 --> 08:39.024
It's pretty spacious.

118
08:39.105 --> 08:41.664
The oven and dishwasher are both brand-new.

119
08:41.745 --> 08:43.385
Here's the master bedroom.

120
08:43.465 --> 08:45.305
The natural light is especially nice in winter.

121
08:45.385 --> 08:46.985
This entire side will get plenty of sun.

122
08:48.425 --> 08:49.825
And here's the closet.

123
08:50.465 --> 08:53.345
No matter how many clothes you have, there'll be plenty of room for them.

124
08:55.785 --> 08:56.665
Here's the balcony.

125
08:56.745 --> 08:59.265
We can plant some greenery here.

126
08:59.825 --> 09:02.145
On nice sunny days, lounging here with a good book

127
09:02.225 --> 09:03.425
is going to feel so comfortable.

128
09:04.865 --> 09:05.705
Chen Yanzhou.

129
09:08.025 --> 09:08.945
Aren't you tired?

130
09:09.905 --> 09:10.825
Not at all.

131
09:11.625 --> 09:12.505
You're lying.

132
09:13.225 --> 09:15.265
You must have put a lot of effort into this place.

133
09:15.345 --> 09:16.505
How about this?

134
09:16.585 --> 09:19.145
When we move, you supervise while I do the heavy lifting.

135
09:19.985 --> 09:21.345
How could I let you do that?

136
09:21.425 --> 09:23.145
This is an order, my roommate.

137
09:25.185 --> 09:26.025
As you command.

138
10:00.705 --> 10:02.545
How is everything already packed up?

139
10:02.625 --> 10:03.545
You didn't wait for me?

140
10:04.585 --> 10:05.505
Didn't I tell you?

141
10:05.585 --> 10:08.385
You just need to supervise and I'll do the heavy lifting.

142
10:10.825 --> 10:12.065
You never said I couldn't help.

143
10:20.105 --> 10:22.025
Still working this late?

144
10:23.145 --> 10:24.145
No.

145
10:24.225 --> 10:25.705
I just need to upload a few files.

146
10:37.225 --> 10:38.065
What's wrong?

147
10:40.745 --> 10:41.705
Nothing.

148
11:20.305 --> 11:21.145
Chen Yanzhou.

149
11:23.465 --> 11:25.145
Where are you sleeping tonight?

150
11:29.665 --> 11:30.545
The sofa.

151
11:47.785 --> 11:50.465
We still have to move tomorrow, so get some rest.

152
11:55.905 --> 11:57.185
Where's my pillow?

153
12:00.585 --> 12:02.225
I don't know. What pillow?

154
12:02.305 --> 12:03.745
The one I use on the sofa.

155
12:06.745 --> 12:10.665
I might've packed it in one of the boxes.

156
12:10.745 --> 12:12.225
You packed it?

157
12:25.505 --> 12:27.385
Okay, I'll look for it.

158
12:27.465 --> 12:28.305
Wait.

159
12:31.305 --> 12:34.185
Last time, you gave me one of your pillows.

160
12:34.265 --> 12:36.345
I have two in my room. I'll get you one.

161
12:38.785 --> 12:40.465
Well, thanks then.

162
12:55.025 --> 12:55.865
Good night.

163
12:57.305 --> 12:58.145
Good night.

164
13:16.505 --> 13:17.785
Zheng Yu.

165
13:17.865 --> 13:19.825
Are you hiding something from us?

166
13:19.905 --> 13:22.425
XU FANGLI

167
13:22.505 --> 13:23.785
Can I ask you something?

168
13:23.865 --> 13:27.265
If there is someone you actively approach and they respond,

169
13:27.345 --> 13:28.985
but won't take things any further,

170
13:29.065 --> 13:30.105
why is that?

171
13:31.185 --> 13:35.705
What kind of "actively approach" and "take things any further" do you mean?

172
13:40.705 --> 13:41.945
Just forget it.

173
13:48.465 --> 13:49.625
I knew it!

174
13:49.705 --> 13:51.825
You didn't send that message by mistake last time.

175
13:56.425 --> 13:57.905
Why so quiet all of a sudden?

176
13:59.625 --> 14:01.745
Did you fall asleep again?

177
14:03.705 --> 14:06.745
You're going to make me lose sleep over this.

178
14:06.825 --> 14:08.225
I'm going to sleep.

179
14:08.305 --> 14:09.265
I have to move tomorrow,

180
14:09.345 --> 14:11.145
and there's still a lot to do.

181
15:06.105 --> 15:07.145
Why are you copying me?

182
15:09.985 --> 15:11.625
A new home calls for a fresh look.

183
15:11.705 --> 15:14.345
Look. Doesn't it look much better arranged this way?

184
15:32.625 --> 15:33.545
Wait a minute.

185
15:33.625 --> 15:35.905
You said you were moving. Where are you moving to?

186
15:36.905 --> 15:39.385
And about that question you asked, I've given it some more thought.

187
15:39.465 --> 15:41.545
Could he be into platonic love?

188
15:52.785 --> 15:53.865
What's wrong?

189
15:55.585 --> 15:56.465
Nothing.

190
16:23.945 --> 16:26.505
It really feels like a real home now.

191
16:27.865 --> 16:29.425
It already is a home.

192
16:45.105 --> 16:45.985
What's wrong?

193
16:47.065 --> 16:49.585
Nothing. I'm just happy.

194
18:04.625 --> 18:07.385
What are you…?

195
18:08.185 --> 18:09.465
I'm sleeping on the sofa.

196
18:15.865 --> 18:16.705
The power's out.

197
18:17.865 --> 18:18.985
Stay right there. Don't move.

198
18:47.145 --> 18:48.785
It's probably a building management issue.

199
18:48.865 --> 18:51.865
We only signed the papers yesterday, so there's probably still things to sort out.

200
18:54.425 --> 18:55.625
So what do we do?

201
18:57.105 --> 18:59.145
We'll just have to make do tonight.

202
18:59.225 --> 19:01.145
I'll have the landlord take care of it tomorrow.

203
19:35.065 --> 19:38.905
Chen Yanzhou, do you remember the trip we went on for our field practice?

204
19:39.585 --> 19:41.225
I went out, and you came looking for me.

205
19:41.305 --> 19:43.225
We were at the campsite,

206
19:43.305 --> 19:44.745
just like this.

207
19:46.585 --> 19:47.505
I remember.

208
19:48.345 --> 19:50.425
But it's not raining today.

209
19:58.305 --> 19:59.465
The power's out.

210
19:59.545 --> 20:00.985
We can't really do anything.

211
20:03.025 --> 20:05.185
I have some movies downloaded on my computer.

212
20:05.265 --> 20:06.905
We could watch one if you liked?

213
20:08.505 --> 20:09.505
I'll get it then.

214
20:25.145 --> 20:28.945
And about that question you asked, I've given it some more thought.

215
20:29.025 --> 20:31.905
Could he be into platonic love?

216
20:40.145 --> 20:41.505
Chen Yanzhou.

217
20:42.745 --> 20:45.665
Are you… into platonic love?

218
20:50.305 --> 20:53.225
You always stop halfway through kissing,

219
20:53.305 --> 20:55.345
and you sleep on the sofa every night.

220
20:56.225 --> 20:57.665
Xu Fangli said…

221
20:59.025 --> 21:01.985
I didn't tell her about us or mention your name.

222
21:02.825 --> 21:04.385
It just came up in conversation.

223
21:05.065 --> 21:07.185
She said that in situations like this, usually…

224
21:28.465 --> 21:29.305
Zheng Yu.

225
21:30.265 --> 21:31.465
Are you joking?

226
21:33.025 --> 21:35.545
I'm serious.

227
21:37.585 --> 21:39.705
Then what gave you such a huge misconception?

228
21:40.625 --> 21:42.305
Didn't I just tell you?

229
21:42.385 --> 21:44.345
Every time you kiss, you stop halfway through…

230
21:47.585 --> 21:48.665
What did you say?

231
21:51.705 --> 21:54.785
You always stop halfway through kissing,

232
21:54.865 --> 21:56.465
and you sleep on the sofa every night.

233
21:56.545 --> 21:58.145
It's the same today.

234
21:59.665 --> 22:01.225
Haven't you noticed

235
22:01.905 --> 22:03.905
that I've been holding back this whole time?

236
22:04.865 --> 22:06.505
I've been waiting for you to be ready.

237
22:09.305 --> 22:10.465
Even today?

238
22:52.905 --> 22:54.105
It's raining.

239
22:56.345 --> 22:57.465
Don't get distracted.

240
23:30.785 --> 23:32.265
Morning.

241
23:32.345 --> 23:33.225
Morning.

242
23:35.425 --> 23:36.825
Did you sleep well last night?

243
23:40.665 --> 23:41.745
I can tell.

244
23:41.825 --> 23:43.185
Look at your bedhead.

245
23:53.105 --> 23:54.065
XIAOMIAN

246
23:54.145 --> 23:55.385
It's Xiaomian.

247
23:55.465 --> 23:57.425
What… do I do?

248
23:57.505 --> 23:59.345
-I… -Perfect timing. Answer it.

249
23:59.905 --> 24:01.505
I haven't talked to him in ages.

250
24:01.585 --> 24:03.145
Let me chat with him later for a bit.

251
24:09.265 --> 24:10.265
You…

252
24:10.985 --> 24:12.985
Are you planning to…?

253
24:13.065 --> 24:16.865
I'm not ready to tell Xiaomian about us yet.

254
24:16.945 --> 24:18.745
Could you step away for a bit?

255
24:26.225 --> 24:27.345
Never mind.

256
24:27.425 --> 24:29.705
Conveniently enough, I have a few emails to take care of.

257
24:45.665 --> 24:47.905
Surprise, Ms. Zheng!

258
24:47.985 --> 24:49.225
Gao Xing?

259
24:57.865 --> 24:59.865
Why are you using Xiaomian's phone?

260
24:59.945 --> 25:02.665
He's free on weekends, so I asked him to tutor me.

261
25:02.745 --> 25:05.265
Let me tell you, he is super strict!

262
25:05.345 --> 25:06.265
He makes me study all day.

263
25:06.345 --> 25:08.585
Time's up. Get back to your exercises.

264
25:09.705 --> 25:10.905
I have my own phone too.

265
25:12.185 --> 25:14.905
I'll talk to you again once I finish my homework, Ms. Zheng.

266
25:14.985 --> 25:15.985
Okay.

267
25:16.585 --> 25:19.585
Zheng Yu, why did you take so long to answer?

268
25:20.545 --> 25:22.665
I didn't hear it ringing.

269
25:23.585 --> 25:26.065
What were you doing? How could you not hear it?

270
25:30.065 --> 25:33.265
Is it hot in your dorm? Or is it the lighting?

271
25:33.345 --> 25:35.025
Why is your face so red?

272
25:35.825 --> 25:36.985
I…

273
25:38.025 --> 25:41.665
It suddenly got cold recently, so they've turned on the heating indoors.

274
25:41.745 --> 25:43.225
They turned on the heat this early?

275
25:43.825 --> 25:45.545
Make sure to dress warmly when you go out.

276
25:46.145 --> 25:47.065
Okay.

277
25:47.145 --> 25:48.545
Zheng Yu.

278
25:48.625 --> 25:50.945
Now that you're over there, have you seen Yanzhou?

279
25:54.265 --> 25:56.625
I haven't had a chance to see him yet.

280
25:56.705 --> 25:57.985
He's been pretty busy lately.

281
25:59.865 --> 26:02.625
I thought he'd be really happy to see you there.

282
26:02.705 --> 26:03.585
Never mind.

283
26:03.665 --> 26:06.105
It's already been a year. People change, after all.

284
26:07.025 --> 26:08.705
Zheng Yu, just ignore him.

285
26:10.985 --> 26:12.225
What was that noise?

286
26:13.905 --> 26:16.025
My roommate. I don't know what's wrong with them.

287
26:16.105 --> 26:20.065
Roommate? Is that the weird roommate you were talking about?

288
26:20.145 --> 26:22.265
No, that roommate has moved out.

289
26:22.345 --> 26:25.025
Don't worry. The person living with me now is my new roommate.

290
26:26.225 --> 26:29.905
My new roommate is a really good person.

291
26:30.505 --> 26:34.265
Even when I sometimes go a little too far,

292
26:34.345 --> 26:38.345
that person is incredibly understanding and would never hold it against me.

293
26:38.425 --> 26:39.745
That's good then.

294
26:40.265 --> 26:42.625
Zheng Yu, it must be mealtime over there.

295
26:42.705 --> 26:43.625
I won't keep you.

296
26:44.665 --> 26:45.505
All right.

297
26:45.585 --> 26:47.985
Let's talk again if anything comes up.

298
26:48.065 --> 26:49.065
Bye.

299
26:50.185 --> 26:51.425
Bye.

300
26:52.905 --> 26:53.785
Where are you going?

301
26:56.025 --> 26:56.865
To get chopsticks.

302
27:01.905 --> 27:03.905
Are you mad?

303
27:08.025 --> 27:12.225
I was just worried that if I told Xiaomian we'd met,

304
27:12.305 --> 27:15.545
he'd start asking questions and find out we're living together.

305
27:15.625 --> 27:17.025
So I…

306
27:19.905 --> 27:21.665
I was wrong.

307
27:27.745 --> 27:29.905
"People change, after all. Just ignore him."

308
27:31.705 --> 27:34.585
So that's the kind of guy I am in Xiaomian's eyes now.

309
27:34.665 --> 27:37.265
And someone here can't even help clear things up for me.

310
27:37.345 --> 27:41.625
Then I'll call him right now and tell him we've seen each other.

311
27:41.705 --> 27:44.545
And not only that, we're living together now.

312
27:45.945 --> 27:49.825
And right before he called, we were kissing.

313
27:53.305 --> 27:55.265
Let's be precise. We didn't actually kiss.

314
28:15.305 --> 28:17.905
This make-up effort of yours is way too half-hearted.

315
28:19.225 --> 28:20.945
Half-hearted?

316
28:21.025 --> 28:23.465
Just how terrible of a sin did I commit?

317
28:25.945 --> 28:27.145
A huge one.

318
28:28.465 --> 28:29.425
How about…

319
28:30.265 --> 28:31.185
I throw this in too?

320
28:42.185 --> 28:43.425
It's Gao Xing.

321
28:46.825 --> 28:47.785
I should answer it.

322
28:49.825 --> 28:50.705
Let me answer it.

323
28:56.265 --> 28:58.385
Ms. Zheng, I'm done with my exercises!

324
28:58.465 --> 28:59.785
Gao Xing, I--

325
28:59.865 --> 29:02.705
Gao Xing, my girlfriend's private time is very expensive.

326
29:02.785 --> 29:05.345
From now on, every minute will be deducted from your New Year's money.

327
29:05.425 --> 29:07.505
-If you agree, keep talking. -You…

328
29:08.625 --> 29:09.465
She hung up.

329
29:11.105 --> 29:12.145
You…

330
29:12.225 --> 29:13.625
What are you doing?

331
29:13.705 --> 29:17.305
I was just trying to tease her. Who knew she'd get scared so easily?

332
29:18.625 --> 29:20.425
As her older cousin, how could you do that to her?

333
29:21.505 --> 29:24.065
All right. I'll send her a red packet later to make it up to her.

334
29:24.985 --> 29:26.065
-Let's eat. -You…

335
29:27.265 --> 29:28.705
Otherwise, you'll be late for class.

336
30:34.385 --> 30:37.665
Tomato…

337
30:37.745 --> 30:39.065
What are you muttering to yourself?

338
30:39.905 --> 30:42.785
I'm memorizing German words for the things I need to buy later.

339
30:45.065 --> 30:46.865
Isn't there a teacher standing right next to you?

340
30:48.305 --> 30:49.865
So how do you say tomato?

341
30:49.945 --> 30:50.865
Tomate?

342
30:50.945 --> 30:52.025
Tomate.

343
30:52.105 --> 30:53.225
Tomate.

344
30:53.305 --> 30:55.305
-Lemon? -Zitrone.

345
30:57.545 --> 30:59.465
Passionfruit?

346
31:00.105 --> 31:01.545
Die Maracuja.

347
31:04.665 --> 31:06.545
What about Brussels sprouts?

348
31:06.625 --> 31:07.905
I bet you don't know that one.

349
31:08.745 --> 31:09.945
Der Rosenkohl.

350
31:10.025 --> 31:11.425
What else do you want to know?

351
31:13.945 --> 31:15.265
My name, Zheng Yu.

352
31:15.345 --> 31:16.625
How do you say my name?

353
31:19.505 --> 31:20.905
Regenschauer.

354
31:20.985 --> 31:22.545
It means a passing shower in Chinese.

355
31:22.625 --> 31:23.825
"Regenschauer."

356
31:24.705 --> 31:26.585
What about Chen Yanzhou?

357
31:31.625 --> 31:33.825
Die Liebe meines Lebens.

358
31:34.705 --> 31:37.385
"Die Liebe meines Lebens."

359
31:40.825 --> 31:41.945
Why are you laughing?

360
31:42.025 --> 31:43.345
Was my pronunciation wrong?

361
31:43.425 --> 31:44.985
Your pronunciation was perfect.

362
31:45.065 --> 31:46.345
Say it again.

363
31:46.425 --> 31:48.585
Die Liebe meines Lebens.

364
31:53.665 --> 31:56.265
Die Liebe meines Lebens.

365
31:59.265 --> 32:01.065
THE LOVE OF MY LIFE

366
32:02.665 --> 32:03.825
Chen Yanzhou.

367
32:03.905 --> 32:04.825
You tricked me!

368
32:06.345 --> 32:07.345
Why are you hitting me?

369
32:07.425 --> 32:08.585
Am I not the love of your life?

370
32:08.665 --> 32:10.905
How can you hit the person you love the most?

371
32:11.905 --> 32:14.305
I hit you because I feel like it! You're so childish!

372
32:14.385 --> 32:15.665
Don't you run!

373
32:16.705 --> 32:18.065
Okay, I'll stop.

374
32:22.145 --> 32:23.585
Look at that pear.

375
32:23.665 --> 32:24.785
It's so tiny and cute!

376
32:24.865 --> 32:26.385
This one?

377
32:26.465 --> 32:29.265
The mangoes are cute too, all nice and red.

378
32:31.105 --> 32:32.185
Strawberries!

379
32:39.305 --> 32:41.505
Chen Yanzhou, why are you getting so much fruit?

380
32:44.905 --> 32:46.065
To bribe you.

381
32:46.665 --> 32:47.745
To bribe me?

382
32:48.625 --> 32:50.385
Come meet someone with me tomorrow.

383
32:51.425 --> 32:52.785
Who?

384
32:52.865 --> 32:54.745
You'll know tomorrow. It's very important.

385
33:13.625 --> 33:15.505
Who are you taking me to meet?

386
33:15.585 --> 33:16.585
A Chinese person?

387
33:17.545 --> 33:18.505
A German person.

388
33:20.145 --> 33:21.065
A woman?

389
33:25.665 --> 33:27.665
What kind of woman?

390
33:31.825 --> 33:32.785
She

391
33:33.585 --> 33:35.065
is blonde,

392
33:35.145 --> 33:36.705
very tall,

393
33:36.785 --> 33:38.465
and incredibly elegant.

394
33:38.545 --> 33:39.825
She also speaks fluent English.

395
33:40.545 --> 33:43.505
We used to discuss art and philosophy together.

396
33:48.345 --> 33:49.305
Why?

397
33:49.905 --> 33:50.985
Are you jealous?

398
33:51.985 --> 33:53.505
I'm not.

399
33:53.585 --> 33:54.505
Keep going.

400
34:00.345 --> 34:01.905
She also likes these kinds of tulips.

401
34:02.545 --> 34:05.105
She said they remind her of the gardens back home.

402
34:14.065 --> 34:16.465
She's practically eaten at every restaurant in Berlin.

403
34:16.545 --> 34:18.505
She's the one who recommended this place to me.

404
34:19.105 --> 34:21.025
Of everyone I've ever met,

405
34:21.105 --> 34:22.264
she knows the most about food.

406
34:22.344 --> 34:25.425
Everyone who meets her is immediately drawn to her.

407
34:26.824 --> 34:28.665
Who on earth is she?

408
34:30.505 --> 34:31.425
She's here.

409
34:47.665 --> 34:49.824
Eleonore was my very first professor when I came to Berlin.

410
34:49.905 --> 34:52.545
She retired at the end of last year and left the research institute.

411
34:52.625 --> 34:54.465
This is her husband, Karl.

412
35:39.025 --> 35:40.505
Karl is a very romantic man.

413
35:41.225 --> 35:42.345
"Lang man."

414
37:01.865 --> 37:04.345
But aren't you joining your professor's project group?

415
37:04.425 --> 37:07.105
-Will you have enough time? -It's fine.

416
38:46.705 --> 38:49.305
We probably should have walked Eleonore and Karl back.

417
38:49.385 --> 38:50.705
It's so dark out now.

418
38:52.505 --> 38:53.345
It's fine.

419
38:53.425 --> 38:56.225
They like taking walks together, just like we're doing now.

420
38:57.665 --> 38:58.705
That's sweet.

421
38:58.785 --> 39:01.105
They've been walking together for almost 50 years

422
39:01.185 --> 39:02.945
and they can still take a walk home together.

423
39:05.105 --> 39:07.225
Looks like we need to practice hard too.

424
39:07.785 --> 39:08.745
Practice for what?

425
39:09.385 --> 39:10.665
For 50 years of walking together.

426
39:11.585 --> 39:13.025
I remember back at the Sports Meet,

427
39:13.105 --> 39:15.225
you ran the 1500 m and then did the 3000 m right after!

428
39:16.105 --> 39:18.905
Walking for 60 or 70 years shouldn't be a problem at all.

429
39:30.905 --> 39:33.705
By the way, are you going to the lab this weekend?

430
39:33.785 --> 39:34.705
Yes.

431
39:34.785 --> 39:36.585
My advisor is going on a business trip next week,

432
39:36.665 --> 39:38.105
so our group meeting got moved up.

433
39:40.745 --> 39:42.705
What's wrong? Do you have plans?

434
39:43.985 --> 39:44.825
No, it's nothing.

435
39:46.465 --> 39:47.745
Let's go home and get some sleep!

436
40:34.065 --> 40:35.345
ZHENG YU

437
40:35.425 --> 40:37.745
I'll be working late today, so don't wait up for me.

438
40:53.305 --> 40:58.105
DORM 223 LET'S GO

439
40:58.185 --> 41:00.465
Zheng Yu, happy birthday!

440
41:00.545 --> 41:02.665
Happy birthday!

441
41:02.745 --> 41:05.425
Is anyone celebrating with you?

442
41:05.505 --> 41:08.305
Happy birthday, Zheng Yu!

443
41:09.985 --> 41:11.265
That's right.

444
41:11.345 --> 41:12.465
It's my birthday today.

445
41:12.545 --> 41:14.585
Where's Zheng Yu?

446
41:14.665 --> 41:15.625
She's probably asleep.

447
41:15.705 --> 41:17.705
It's nighttime in Berlin right now.

448
41:20.945 --> 41:24.945
XU FANGLI: HAPPY BIRTHDAY, ZHENG YU

449
41:25.025 --> 41:26.505
It's bait for the fish.

450
41:27.425 --> 41:29.385
Why isn't the fish taking the bait?

451
41:33.905 --> 41:35.745
Zheng Yu, happy birthday!

452
41:35.825 --> 41:39.225
Ms. Zheng, I heard from someone that it's your birthday.

453
41:39.305 --> 41:41.625
Happy birthday!

454
41:41.705 --> 41:43.745
Did Yanzhou buy you a cake?

455
41:43.825 --> 41:48.065
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone about the two of you.

456
41:48.145 --> 41:49.425
Are you still at the lab?

457
41:49.505 --> 41:50.665
CHEN YANZHOU

458
41:50.745 --> 41:53.145
By the way, are you going to the lab this weekend?

459
41:53.225 --> 41:56.025
Yes. My advisor is going on a business trip next week,

460
41:56.105 --> 41:57.705
so our group meeting got moved up.

461
42:07.145 --> 42:07.985
Hello?

462
44:52.265 --> 44:57.265
Subtitle translation by: Cempaka Malinja
